Modelica source:
```modelica
connector Flange
  Real s;
  flow Real f;
end Flange;
model Mass
  Flange p;
end Mass;
model Hub
  Flange left;
  Flange right;
  Mass a;
  Mass b;
  Mass c;
equation
  connect(right,c.p);
  connect(c.p,b.p);
  connect(b.p,a.p);
  connect(a.p,left);
end Hub;
model Study
  Hub h;
end Study;
```

Question:
Within the equation scope of model instance Study.h, return the canonical signed member vector for the primitive flow connection set generated there that contains h.left.f.

Target:
h.left.f

Answer format:
Use ascending path:integer entries joined by commas without spaces; coefficients must be primitive, nonzero, and oriented so the first coefficient is positive.
Return exactly {"answer":"..."}.
